\section{Experiments}
\label{sec: experiments}
    In this section, we present a comprehensive evaluation and aim to answer the following questions:
    \textbf{Q1}: In the multi-level FGL heterogeneity, can FedPG outperform existing SOTA baselines? (Sec.~\ref{sec: Performance Comparison})
    \textbf{Q2}: What is the generalization ability of FedPG in Graph-FL (Sec.~\ref{appendix: Experiments for Graph-FL})? 
    \textbf{Q3}: If FedPG is effective, what contributes to its performance (Sec.~\ref{sec: Ablation Study and In-depth Analysis})?
    \textbf{Q4}: How does the robustness of FedPG when employing noise-based privacy preservation (Sec.~\ref{sec: Robustness in Noise-based Privacy Preservation})?
    \textbf{Q5}: How does FedPG perform under sparse settings and low client participation (Sec.~\ref{sec: Performance under Sparse Settings})?


