    \textbf{Prototype Learning}.
    We investigate the contributions of RF-prompted context (RF Context) and Margin-based Enhancement (Ada. Margin) in Eq.(\ref{eq: fedpg server loss}).
    Specifically, RF Context enhances the generalization of global prototypes by providing rich graph context samples for subsequent CL, which brings 2.21\% average performance improvement.
