We additionally make the following observations.
First, although EA is not SD-truthful in $J_2$ (but still truthful), its sensitivity is competitive with other truthful mechanisms.
Second, the sensitivity of the partition rounding versions of CA and MA is consistently dominated by other SD-truthful mechanisms.
