\myparagraph{Observation 1: Message size matters}
%This paper emphasizes the importance of understanding performance trends with message sizes fed into each type of accelerator. 
Fig.~\ref{fig:profiling} shows the unique (non-linear) relations between each accelerator's compute throughput and its input data sizes. 
