\myparagraph{Observation 4: Different QP numbers impact bandwidth allocation} 
We sweep the QP number from 1 to 16 for each tenant.
Based on our explorations on two tenants both sending 4KB RDMA writes, we find the throughput ratio between two tenants ($T_{q}$) is equal to the ratio of QP numbers.
