\subsection{Analysis of a Recovery from Power Loss}
\label{sec:res_disr}


During the experiment (\cref{sec:res_mult}), between the 718th and 720th seconds, we cut power to four limbs of the \mBZ. This causes the robot to fall before standing back up and continuing the trajectory \cref{fig:distu3,fig:traj_main}.

