 &  +  \Big\| y^i_t - \sum_{i=1}^N w^i \hat{y}^i \Big\|^2  + \hat{\mathbf{y}}^\top P_i(t+1) \hat{\mathbf{y}} + 2 S_i(t+1)^\top \hat{\mathbf{y}} , 
