(One could also check all legal moves and apply the best one. However, preliminary experiments showed that this would not significantly improve the outcome, 
so we opted for the faster variant.)}
Once this has been done for all tasks on the current processor, we process the tasks
of the next processor in the ranking. 
At each round, we record whether we had a positive gain or not. If there was one round through the tasks without gain, 
we stop the local search. 
