In \cite{hu2020joint}, the authors considered a system where one LEO satellite assists BSs in providing wireless backhaul links to UAVs serving remote users. The authors optimized user association and resource allocation to meet user demands while minimizing energy consumption. The numerical results show that the proposed scheme can realize almost $1.5$ times the sum rate compared to the scenario without satellites.
