\section{Satellite-Assisted LAE}

This section presents a satellite-assisted LAE framework, where satellites and LAVs leverage the distributed MIMO to overcome challenges in satellite-LAV communications. A two-timescale optimization scheme is integrated to reduce control signaling overhead.
