To tackle the aforementioned issues, we propose a satellite-assisted LAE framework based on distributed MIMO, which is demonstrated in \textit{Part (i)} of Fig. \ref{fig:sat_lae_cf}. Specifically, there are three important components in the considered framework: distributed satellite MIMO, distributed LAV MIMO, and a two-timescale optimization scheme.
