%   \item \textbf{LAV MIMO:} The LAV MIMO is a LAV fleet. The reason is that one LAV fleet is responsible for the same mission, and is is reasonable to assume that LAVs within a fleet transmit and receive the same information. Thus, they can also act as a distributed MIMO, and the leader LAV in the fleet acts as a control center. The LAV MIMO can help reduce the transmission power of individual LAVs and enhance the received signal strength.
