\subsection{Main results: Classification}

\mname{} achieves strong performance across classification tasks (3D MedMNIST, CC\mbox{-}CCII, and CTRG; Tables~\ref{tab:main}\,\&\,\ref{tab:more}), evaluated using AUROC and accuracy as in the MedMNIST benchmark \cite{yang2023medmnist}.
It obtains the highest accuracy in 6 of 9 datasets and ranks among the top two on 8 of 9 (by AUC). When combined, \mname{} and \mnameB{} achieve the best–reported AUCs on five 3D MedMNIST categories.

