Models that leverage pretraining (MISFM, SuPreM, SLIViT, VoCo, Merlin, \mname{}) generally score higher than those trained from scratch (3D ResNet and MAE). Across all classification datasets, \mname{} on average improved metrics by $+2\%$ over SuPreM, $+4\%$ over MISFM, $+9\%$ over Merlin, $+10\%$ over VoCo, and $+13\%$ over SLIViT.

