\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}

We evaluate our approach on datasets commonly used in generative modeling: \textrm{FFHQ-128} ($128\times128$ resolution, $70{,}000$ training samples), 
\textrm{MNIST} ($28\times28$ pixels, $60{,}000$ training images, $10{,}000$ testing).

